        <activityName xml:lang="en">Hexafluorethane, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Hexafluorethane, at plant
The multioutput-process "ethylene chlorofluorination" delivers the co-products monochloropentafluoroethane and hexafluoroethane. The allocation is based on stoechiometric calculation.;
UUID: 486e062f-5482-3283-8055-84c76a6040bf
